e of tag. The unique hand-based locomotion system offers an immersive experience, allowing you to navigate the world with fluid, natural movements.\n\nIn Noob Swingers, you can explore various game modes, from casual social hangouts to intense competitive matches.", "short_description": "Noob Swingers is an exhilarating VR game inspired by the popular Gorilla Tag. Dive into a vibrant, open-world environment where you embody agile creatures, using your arms to swing, climb, and tag your friends in a thrilling game of tag. The unique hand-based locomotion system offers an immersive experience, allowing you to navigate the world with fluid, natural movements.\n\nIn Noob Swingers, you can explore various game modes, from casual social hangouts to intense competitive matches."}]}, "developer_name": "Laxyen", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/noobswingers/privacy-policy?authuser=0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skibidi Gorilla", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/noobswingers/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "8586659668087908"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binar